# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env* is gitignored — never commit real
# values. Neither variable below is required to run the site: without them
# the pages render normally and the assistant reports that it isn't
# configured rather than failing.

# Server-only (no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix, so it never reaches the browser).
# Required for the "Ask about Zimran" assistant to answer.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Canonical site URL used for metadata. Defaults to
# http://localhost:3000 in development; set it to the deployed origin in
# production.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.example
